SUMMARY:Christmas Lights 🎄 Food bank Run
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Robyn Hall\n\nA social\, non-club\, run to see the epic
  Christmas lights of Malvern Link and Support the Foodbank.  \nKids and oth
 ers welcome so long as the can comfortably cover the distance. \n\n7k in ap
 proximately 1hr. Meeting at Victoria Park car park. \n\nTo support the Malv
 ern food bank at what is always a difficult time of year. I'd be very grate
 ful if people could bring an item that I will take uo to the Lyttleton Well
  for them to distribute. \nI will add their current shortages/requests near
 er the time to a discussion post but please feel free to bring anything you
  may already have that isn't on the list. They will be grateful for all. \n
 \nSome of the light displays we visit also hsve collection tins for various
  charities so please bring a little cash if you are able to to donate to th
 em too. \n\nTorches and Visible clothing required. Christmas attire optiona
 l 🎄\n\nLirf : Robyn [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://w
 ww.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3557466633286157868\n\nSynced from 
 Strava Club 208705 on Fri\, 27 Nov @ 11:31 AM
