  see the epic Christmas lights of Malvern Link and Support the Foodbank.  K
 ids and others welcome so long as the can comfortably cover the distance. 7
 k in approximately 1hr. Meeting at Victoria Park car park. To support the M
 alvern food bank at what is always a difficult time of year. I'd be very gr
 ateful if people could bring an item that I will take uo to the Lyttleton W
 ell for them to distribute. I will add their current shortages/requests nea
 rer the time to a discussion post but please feel free to bring anything yo
 u may already have that isn't on the list. They will be grateful for all. S
 ome of the light displays we visit also hsve collection tins for various ch
 arities so please bring a little cash if you are able to to donate to them 
