SUMMARY:Holywell choose your distance!
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Boris Kachscovsky\n\nChoose your distance!\n\nWe'll do 
 laps around Holywell with potentially some mall trail run detours. Each lap
  is 3.6km and we'll loop back to the start so drop off whenever you've had 
 enough.\n\nGreat for those of you who might want to try for a longer distan
 ce without commitment.\n\n3.6k / 7.2k /10.8k/14.4k /etc.\n\nHolywell is lov
 ely with a bit of a slope and some nice gas lamps\, but no sidewalks so bri
 ng as many lights/hi-viz things you can muster!\n\nWe'll meet at the north 
 entrance to Holywell.\n\nIf driving: park on Wells Road or along Holywell a
 nd meet at the intersection of holywell and wells road.\n\n6-7min/km - thou
 gh potentially slower if you make me run round a hundred times\, nobody lef
 t behind\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_event
 s/3559213697385978738\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Fri\, 27 Nov @ 1
 1:31 AM
